      "side": 1,
      "message": "I still think SuperSpeed (TM) signals are still high speed signals. Also it is possible to use USB 2.0 over a USB-C connection, so that may be HighSpeed (TM) signals or SuperSpeed (TM) signals. Both to me are high speed.",
